# TypeScript incremental build cache — per-developer machine state, never commit.
# `**/*.env` above already covers ui/.env in principle, but the file was tracked
# in a prior commit; the `git rm --cached` accompanying this rule unsticks it.
*.tsbuildinfo
ui/nginx/ssl/key.pem
data

# IRC service ephemeral state — chat history + Ergo's WAL files. Per-host
# runtime data, never commit.
ergo/*.db
ergo/*.db-shm
ergo/*.db-wal

# Repo-local scratch is BANNED. Design docs / running logs / venvs /
# audit reports go to the parent-of-repo `scratch/` dir
# (../scratch/docs/ibl/ for IBL work on the mac side, ~/scratch/
# on spark). Pinning this here so a future `git add` can't accidentally
# sweep a scratch/ tree into the repo.
scratch/